{
  "id": "subject-log",
  "name": "medical",
  "category": "实验体观察日志",
  "description": "一份实验体的行为观察记录",
  "trigger": {
    "type": "random",
    "probability": 0.015,
    "conditions": []
  },
  "variables": {
    "subjectId": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "实验体编号"
    },
    "name": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "实验体姓名"
    },
    "observer": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "观察员姓名"
    },
    "date": {
      "type": "date",
      "description": "观察日期"
    },
    "behavior": {
      "type": "text",
      "maxLength": 250,
      "description": "行为观察记录"
    },
    "notes": {
      "type": "text",
      "maxLength": 150,
      "description": "备注"
    },
    "status": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "状态",
      "options": [
        "正常",
        "异常",
        "危险",
        "失控"
      ],
      "default": "正常"
    }
  },
  "promptTemplate": "请生成一张「medical」的内容。\n\n背景信息：\n- 当前场景：{{scene}}\n- 发送者：{{sender}}\n- 接收者：{{recipient}}\n\n要求：\n1. 内容要符合该卡片的风格和情境\n2. 语气要自然、有代入感\n3. 字数控制在100-300字之间\n\n请直接输出内容，不要有其他说明。",
  "style": {
    "theme": "typewriter-doc",
    "colors": [
      "#d4c5a9",
      "#333",
      "#555"
    ],
    "mood": "一份实验体的行为观察记录"
  },
  "rarity": "rare",
  "collectible": true
}